---
import '~/styles/siph-widgets.css';
---

<figure class="siph-widget cpo-sheet solver-sheet">
  <div class="siph-widget__accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="siph-widget__head">
    <p class="siph-widget__kicker">示意图</p>
    <p class="siph-widget__title">沿路变不变</p>
  </div>
  <fieldset class="cpo-choice">
    <legend class="cpo-sr">这一问该用哪一种求解器</legend>
    <label>
      直波导 · FDE
      <input type="radio" name="solver-pick" value="fde" checked />
    </label>
    <label>
      锥形、耦合器、MMI · EME
      <input type="radio" name="solver-pick" value="eme" />
    </label>
    <label>
      一维薄膜或布拉格 · TMM
      <input type="radio" name="solver-pick" value="tmm" />
    </label>
    <label>
      光栅、向空气辐射 · FDTD
      <input type="radio" name="solver-pick" value="fdtd" />
    </label>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="siph-widget__stage">
    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="fde">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <svg class="cpo-svg solver-svg" viewBox="0 0 340 148" role="img" aria-label="沿 z 等宽的直波导，只取一个截面解本征模">
          <line class="faint" x1="28" y1="26" x2="292" y2="26"></line>
          <path class="faint" d="M286 22 L298 26 L286 30"></path>
          <text class="solver-label" x="304" y="30">z</text>
          <rect class="ink" x="28" y="64" width="276" height="28"></rect>
          <rect class="hot" x="154" y="48" width="24" height="60"></rect>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="146" y="128">截面</text>
        </svg>
        <p class="cpo-note">截面沿 z 不变，解本征模：传播常数、场形和偏振。射频里对应 HFSS 端口上的二维本征模。</p>
        <p class="cpo-note">截面沿 z 在变的器件，不要只用 FDE。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="eme">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <svg class="cpo-svg solver-svg" viewBox="0 0 340 176" role="img" aria-label="锥形被切成四段当地均匀的波导，段与段之间级联散射矩阵">
          <rect class="ink" x="22" y="96" width="64" height="22"></rect>
          <rect class="ink" x="98" y="78" width="64" height="40"></rect>
          <rect class="ink" x="174" y="56" width="64" height="62"></rect>
          <rect class="ink" x="250" y="34" width="64" height="84"></rect>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="92" y="142" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="168" y="142" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="244" y="142" text-anchor="middle">S</text>
          <text class="solver-label" x="54" y="160" text-anchor="middle">窄</text>
          <text class="solver-label" x="282" y="160" text-anchor="middle">宽</text>
        </svg>
        <p class="cpo-note">切成当地近似均匀的短段，用当地模展开，再把散射矩阵级联。射频里是模式匹配，加上 S 参数级联。</p>
        <p class="cpo-note">大量功率要辐射到空气时，这不是舒适区。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="tmm">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <svg class="cpo-svg solver-svg" viewBox="0 0 340 168" role="img" aria-label="四层均匀薄膜上下相乘，得到整段传递矩阵">
          <rect class="ink" x="80" y="12" width="180" height="20"></rect>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="170" y="46" text-anchor="middle">×</text>
          <rect class="ink" x="80" y="52" width="180" height="20"></rect>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="170" y="86" text-anchor="middle">×</text>
          <rect class="ink" x="80" y="92" width="180" height="20"></rect>
          <text class="solver-label solver-label--accent" x="170" y="126" text-anchor="middle">×</text>
          <rect class="ink" x="80" y="132" width="180" height="20"></rect>
        </svg>
        <p class="cpo-note">每一层是均匀薄层，整段响应是传递矩阵或 ABCD 相乘。射频里就是 ADS 里把 ABCD / T 矩阵串起来。</p>
        <p class="cpo-note">500 nm 的硅条不是一维薄膜，除非已经化成有效一维模型。那个模型通常来自 FDE。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="fdtd">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <svg class="cpo-svg solver-svg" viewBox="0 0 340 168" role="img" aria-label="光栅把光折向空气，计算发生在一块时空网格上">
          <rect class="faint" x="20" y="16" width="300" height="78"></rect>
          <path class="grid" d="M20 42 H320 M20 68 H320 M80 16 V94 M140 16 V94 M200 16 V94 M260 16 V94"></path>
          <text class="solver-label" x="28" y="34">空气</text>
          <rect class="ink" x="20" y="118" width="300" height="22"></rect>
          <rect class="hot" x="58" y="100" width="16" height="18"></rect>
          <rect class="hot" x="118" y="100" width="16" height="18"></rect>
          <rect class="hot" x="178" y="100" width="16" height="18"></rect>
          <rect class="hot" x="238" y="100" width="16" height="18"></rect>
          <path class="accent" d="M66 96 L88 40"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M82 46 L88 40 L80 38"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M126 96 L148 40"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M142 46 L148 40 L140 38"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M186 96 L208 40"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M202 46 L208 40 L200 38"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M246 96 L268 40"></path>
          <path class="accent" d="M262 46 L268 40 L260 38"></path>
        </svg>
        <p class="cpo-note">光栅和向空气辐射，要在时空网格上直接推进麦克斯韦方程。射频里最接近的是时域全波，例如 CST。</p>
        <p class="cpo-note">这不是 ADS 电路瞬态，也不是 HFSS 里常用的频域有限元扫频。又长又缓、EME 能走完的波导电路，不必用它。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="siph-legend">
    <li><i class="swatch-te"></i>这一问真正在解的部分</li>
    <li><i class="swatch-ink"></i>结构轮廓</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="siph-widget__credit">Fierceman · fierceman26.github.io</p>
  <figcaption>
    方法选择的示意，不是标定过的仿真，也不是测到的光谱。图上没有分贝、有效折射率、带宽，也没有场分布。直波导对 FDE；锥形、耦合器、MMI 对 EME；一维薄膜或布拉格对 TMM；光栅和向空气辐射对 FDTD。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
